                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a short and sweet 10 minute VR immersive experience / demo for a game that unfortunately, never made the light of day :(\r\n\r\nThis was absolutely groundbreaking in its day (2016) because it ran perfectly on recommended hardware (Nvidia 970 I think) and was neatly done.\r\n\r\nThe developers never quite got there though, after years of trying to get the game out (I dont think they got the backing)\r\n\r\nStill works well on modern kit (5080 , Valve Index on SSD) \r\n\r\nThere is another 10 minute demo , that partners this :\r\n\r\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/649890/Caliban_Below/\r\n\r\nin 2016 was incredible\r\nin 2026 it's a 6 out of 10",
